  "description": "01.AI (Yi) provider for Zonit.Extensions.Ai library.\nProvides access to Yi series of large language models.\n\nModels included:\n- Yi Large: Flagship model with advanced reasoning (200B parameters)\n- Yi Medium: Balanced performance model (32K context)\n- Yi Vision: Multimodal image understanding\n- Yi Large Turbo: Optimized for speed\n\nFeatures:\n- OpenAI-compatible API format\n- Full streaming support\n- Strong multilingual capabilities (Chinese and English)\n- Long context understanding",
